r greater precision. But experts warn the plan could lead to even more pesticides being used in agriculture.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Politicians call for ban on radical AfD state branches</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bfaac4601995ea0f7bb0d2e55dea7b291da10eb152469b8381dcb4cc237c40a4</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T13:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-politicians-call-for-ban-on-radical-afd-state-branches/live-78555302--c811d211a36d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-politicians-call-for-ban-on-radical-afd-state-branches/live-78555302?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Some German politicians have called for a ban on the far-right Alternative for Germany (AfD) party's more radical state branches. Follow DW for the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Guinea-Bissau votes to reshape presidency</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bf64d9af8f7b2c53d266d0bd47617e40436afa55e3d8c56ab7a60878252014f9</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T12:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/guinea-bissau-votes-to-reshape-presidency/a-78562523--7e1a354db388.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/guinea-bissau-votes-to-reshape-presidency/a-78562523?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The West African nation's military government wants to amend the constitution to give more powers to the president. The junta, which seized power last year, says it will hold elections in December.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ferry carrying over 260 people capsizes off Cyprus</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae8430c49b47e8ff1d425534226e75d1c98521f5152d1a0e0d6aeba53755ab38</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T11:32:00Z</published><link 