een the two countries?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India's citizen-led school audits test limits of activism</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:28d231b049c65ab1d51147f57e88edbdaaec808594151f4e244d848e88ce772a</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T09:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-s-citizen-led-school-audits-test-limits-of-activism/a-78545789--25fb54509cfa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-s-citizen-led-school-audits-test-limits-of-activism/a-78545789?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The student-led "Cockroach" movement is taking its campaign for accountability to government schools, but the activists' methods are encountering growing resistance from authorities.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Manhunt underway after woman killed in Swiss rave shooting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:759914067625e4a0121563bcee9b4a0b33ea159878a307d4de5afeb453c95cc8</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T08:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/manhunt-underway-after-woman-killed-in-swiss-rave-shooting/a-78561106--a466356fb2eb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/manhunt-underway-after-woman-killed-in-swiss-rave-shooting/a-78561106?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The shooting at a rave in the northern Swiss town of Aarau, near Zürich, left at least one person dead and five wounded. Police said they were still searching for the perpetrator or perpetrators.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nepal issues fresh flood warning as 3,000 still missing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3b1a164befebc01a07913fd55859e70f961659e13e74c561a7c1716a12f42dfa</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T06:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nepal-issues-fresh-flood-warning-as-3-000-still-missing/a-78561068--48eceb1c17d9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nepal-issues-fresh-flood-warning-as-3-000-still-missing/a-78561068?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Rescuers are trying to reach dozens of hydropower workers trapped in flooded tunnels, but have been hampered by further rainfall.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Norway’s new King Haakon remembers ‘dear father’ Harald in first speech as sovereign</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1d07a35bb5e5b2a9f2230334d170fd21893b47e53d49bc5670546f4f0fab79af</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T22:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/norway-s-new-king-haakon-remembers-dear-father-harald-in-first-speech-as-sovereign/a-78560155--e2e7927a8438.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/norway-s-new-king-haakon-remembers-dear-father-harald-in-first-speech-as-sovereign/a-78560155?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">New monarch Haakon VIII paid an emotional tribute to his late father, Harald V, in his first address to the nation. Vowing to follow his own path, Haakon pledged to uphold Norway’s democracy, unity and inclusive values.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Turkish, Somali forces free vessel seized by pirates in Somalia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3bcd852ebe8c60a20303d45e4e03c59fb1063228ba5a1bde928c13d8779f489</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T20:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/turkish-somali-forces-free-vessel-seized-by-pirates-in-somalia/a-78560087--b871e49c5cf4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/turkish-somali-forces-free-vessel-seized-by-pirates-in-somalia/a-78560087?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Turkish and Somali forces have freed the MV LUTUF after pirates hijacked the vessel off the coast of Somalia. The 10-day operation killed 14 alleged pirates and destroyed four boats used by the attackers.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Israeli settlers attack Palestinian homes in West Bank</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1ff55b761a4087095698ce15e065547255108113624465fafe940993edfddbe1</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T19:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/israeli-settlers-attack-palestinian-homes-in-west-bank/a-78560116--b111ec029a6d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/israeli-settlers-attack-palestinian-homes-in-west-bank/a-78560116?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Masked Israeli settlers launched their first major attack since initiating a siege in the village of Qusra earlier this month. Saturday's attacks were met with rare criticism from Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Zimbabwe crash involving church minibus kills 27</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3390770844e36765f0e824ea388d5d546418c3841f8c316ca5d885b21e7f2155</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T17:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/zimbabwe-crash-involving-church-minibus-kills-27/a-78558710--47c4d9cd9605.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/zimbabwe-crash-involving-church-minibus-kills-27/a-78558710?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Dozens of people were killed when a minibus carrying churchgoers collided head-on with a truck in central Zimbabwe. The crash near the town of Chivhu is the latest deadly road accident in the African country.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russian-American heads Trump's planned Caucasus trade route</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8ed20b5624d059c9d268431b6afddbea4f12745dc564e2cb2ac0674dd5258251</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T16:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-american-heads-trump-s-planned-caucasus-trade-route/a-78547064--b0ca155f3d56.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-american-heads-trump-s-planned-caucasus-trade-route/a-78547064?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Russian-born businessman heads the investment fund financing the so-called "Trump Route," a planned corridor through Armenia linking Azerbaijan with Nakhchivan. Who is Konstantin Sokolov, and what role does he play?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Saxony-Anhalt election: Why the AfD is so strong</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bf0e5117819eccde3c6cf678ef52cebe784209d64906838302a2d6868815dc00</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T16:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saxony-anhalt-election-why-the-afd-is-so-strong/a-78482588--61fbfe23d5bc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saxony-anhalt-election-why-the-afd-is-so-strong/a-78482588?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The AfD is polling above 40% ahead of Saxony-Anhalt's election on September 6. What is driving support for the far right in this predominantly rural eastern German state?</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>India news: PM Modi in Uzbekistan on way to SCO summit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b2d31f64086da6e0cb6ce2876823eb3d2594e87e3a45e80c9800a4ce99026e8d</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T15:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-pm-modi-in-uzbekistan-on-way-to-sco-summit/live-78554796--f843b31f425e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-pm-modi-in-uzbekistan-on-way-to-sco-summit/live-78554796?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi is in Uzbekistan for a two-day state visit, after which he will go to Kyrgyzstan for the SCO Summit. Meanwhile, hundreds of Indians are still missing in Nepal.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russian strike on ammunition depot near Kyiv kills dozens</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5493e4eb08f82e76ff0c806cd5aec286d39866d748c4a10ce4c811bec1c91070</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T14:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-strike-on-ammunition-depot-near-kyiv-kills-dozens/a-78556008--e5824c3598ec.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-strike-on-ammunition-depot-near-kyiv-kills-dozens/a-78556008?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Hundreds were also forced to flee after a Russian attack near Ukraine's capital, Kyiv, sparked a huge fire and explosions. The strike was the second to hit an arms depot near Kyiv in less than two months.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Death toll from Nepal-Tibet floods rises to over 600</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6b35b4ddddf04a5df53dc4c9bed5e359fa9c40d8be277e3bb84f4dc27112287a</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T14:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/death-toll-from-nepal-tibet-floods-rises-to-over-600/a-78555290--d791e47d5bed.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/death-toll-from-nepal-tibet-floods-rises-to-over-600/a-78555290?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Heavy rain is complicating an already difficult rescue effort, as hundreds remain missing three days after deadly flash floods hit the Nepal-Tibet border region.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Niger's defense ministry says soldiers attempted mutiny</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2cfd04adc8065377678b68f198d792954c891e2b49b64ccb47e277818d8acd24</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T12:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/niger-s-defense-ministry-says-soldiers-attempted-mutiny/a-78554001--08a93516cc58.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/niger-s-defense-ministry-says-soldiers-attempted-mutiny/a-78554001?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Dozens of rebeling soldiers were killed or arrested, state media said. The attack posed the latest threat to Niger's military junta, led by Abdourahamane Tchiani, who seized power in a 2023 coup.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>This extremely successful author polarizes German readers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:965f8afb050fe3a052954d20be25e6b6e7b3c1a33d119f7ac220bef9fde1e79f</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T07:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452--1ca180b39c00.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">She's young and she says what she thinks: Caroline Wahl is topping Germany's bestseller lists with her novels. But she has also faced a public backlash.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Serbia keeps EU, Russia in play ahead of key election</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f2a725e60175a0d3fd72576fcb4c8c3bde1cba187090d0cc03db0db39cdc6ef8</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T07:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/serbia-keeps-eu-russia-in-play-ahead-of-key-election/a-78543495--328f068dfd52.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/serbia-keeps-eu-russia-in-play-ahead-of-key-election/a-78543495?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Serbia heads toward an uncertain election, President Aleksandar Vucic is balancing ties with Russia and EU ambitions. But growing geopolitical tensions and pressure at home are narrowing his room to maneuver.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>What 'The Odyssey' can teach us about climate chaos</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6a854814ea7d83b7511e8864f8880737aa446cb278e68248cb2f594a48eb5489</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T12:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-the-odyssey-can-teach-us-about-climate-chaos/a-78545407--d5adc3479f14.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-the-odyssey-can-teach-us-about-climate-chaos/a-78545407?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Bronze Age collapse may have started with a water crisis. The droughts of today raise the unsettling question of whether it could happen again.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Influential humanists: These are the winners of the Goethe Medal 2026</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1780b337c606ef40a09545195e3074d853388e2c18b53b9be9bc6062467d3ad8</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T12:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/influential-humanists-these-are-the-winners-of-the-goethe-medal-2026/a-78497975--2a003f94b40a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/influential-humanists-these-are-the-winners-of-the-goethe-medal-2026/a-78497975?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The prestigious German cultural award recognizes the artistic work and commitment to cultural dialogue of Arvo Pärt, Anita Raja and Prodromos Tsinikoris.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Why Germany's military is betting on gamers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1868aa9be3c34c82ca316049878b27047ed85659cff03a803998ad1b2f0940af</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T10:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-germany-s-military-is-betting-on-gamers/a-78536462--ee05edf9206e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-germany-s-military-is-betting-on-gamers/a-78536462?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">For the past 10 years, the German armed forces — the Bundeswehr — have been represented at Gamescom, Cologne's video game trade fair. They've been criticized for trying to draw more young people into military careers.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Norway's King Harald dies at 89</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dd9fbfd6f8c5065e8725e161466d066d232bc1b0c413d69f57375d1fc3b0c29f</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T08:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/norway-s-king-harald-dies-at-89/a-78524572--172e0c27118c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/norway-s-king-harald-dies-at-89/a-78524572?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">King Harald is succeeded by his son, who has taken the name King Haakon VIII, with Crown Princess Mette-Marit now queen.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Protesters set fire to migrant camp in Ceuta</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:30d4a596e78cae619ccb03f6e785cfd58286dc2ed432faec3d8535f39e4c6f99</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T00:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/protesters-set-fire-to-migrant-camp-in-ceuta/a-78538847--83821c4e6596.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/protesters-set-fire-to-migrant-camp-in-ceuta/a-78538847?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The unrest comes one month after a mass influx of migrants from Morocco to the Spanish exclave in North Africa.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Spain: Thieves steal Bronze Age gold in lightning raid on Villena Museum</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cf4839d8c5ecc0f96b0018cb25340753f1aabacee860c096c5afc06a3c08c52d</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T19:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spain-thieves-steal-bronze-age-gold-in-lightning-raid-on-villena-museum/a-78538027--71179a9fbd6b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spain-thieves-steal-bronze-age-gold-in-lightning-raid-on-villena-museum/a-78538027?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">One of the world's greatest Bronze Age gold collections has been swiped, almost in its entirety, from Villena Museum. A highly professional group of thieves were in and out in four minutes flat before the museum opened.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ratko Mladic, the man behind Srebrenica massacre, dies at 84</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:49b0fac1dbbe43720a96cc141c7621a9ff2b44c3b432cbca221e8b9874803013</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T19:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ratko-mladic-the-man-behind-srebrenica-massacre-dies-at-84/a-78536491--e099fb931b95.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ratko-mladic-the-man-behind-srebrenica-massacre-dies-at-84/a-78536491?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">For many, Ratko Mladic represented the horrors of the Bosnian war. He was convicted of genocide for the Srebrenica massacre and other war crimes. On Thursday, he died in detention at The Hague.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Tragedy in Nepal: How do flash floods happen?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d345a9719468c1c00e9af17b44089c342194e2d7a295da142ba3b9384f4d5801</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z<