le Iran's shadow economy?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7d9a8fe826fc79c12b1e1df6a3e66a2faead6e4dbc023562f4a29137b7eacdb2</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T10:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-new-us-sanctions-cripple-iran-s-shadow-economy/a-78494630--d793d396bd52.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-new-us-sanctions-cripple-iran-s-shadow-economy/a-78494630?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US is expanding sanctions on Iran's financial networks, targeting crypto, gold, aviation and shipping. DW spoke with analysts about what could change.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Trees are vital for cooler cities, but they need help too</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:80d5194fcf3ee9db81a59a603f0212971be4b2c49655a014a424df07eff6a34e</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T09:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trees-are-vital-for-cooler-cities-but-they-need-help-too/a-78488665--39588bf2d5df.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trees-are-vital-for-cooler-cities-but-they-need-help-too/a-78488665?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Record-breaking heat and drought are putting urban trees at risk. Experts explain how to protect these essential assets and build city forests that can withstand the climate challenges ahead.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>The new Bundesliga season is here, but has the glow gone?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0c2ec3c137fcdd262cd88960e8018777df3b454fdcbc3ff0eed21ce975c81b8a</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-24T14:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-new-bundesliga-season-is-here-but-has-the-glow-gone/a-78062032--f578ab52d735.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-new-bundesliga-season-is-here-but-has-the-glow-gone/a-78062032?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Another Bundesliga season arrives, but are the golden years of Germany's top football league already over, and what can it do to change its course?</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Star violinist Anne-Sophie Mutter: 50 years on stage</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a52dd63affe757ba4d02d2eda9f16e5f518477e6d4df0c82ae9e095301cf4d4a</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-24T11:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/star-violinist-anne-sophie-mutter-50-years-on-stage/a-78484739--30785cb37716.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/star-violinist-anne-sophie-mutter-50-years-on-stage/a-78484739?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Anne-Sophie Mutter constantly reinvents herself. For her 50th onstage anniversary, the star violinist is surprising audiences with sounds from around the world and never-before-recorded commissions.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Scientists discover new 'immune hubs' in skull bone marrow</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aad229c1feef2488b411ae99f147337f091e170362bca31abd4c836f68037281</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-24T08:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/scientists-discover-new-immune-hubs-in-skull-bone-marrow/a-78460417--3ae7f2c7a79f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/scientists-discover-new-immune-hubs-in-skull-bone-marrow/a-78460417?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">"Immune hubs" that actively defend the brain have been discovered in mouse skull marrow. Similar cells exist in human skulls, but their role remains unclear.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Spiraling health costs force Iranians to delay care</title><id>u