ons/a-78475087?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Ukrainian president says wartime elections, as called for by the ex-defense minister, could "split Ukraine." He also said Russia was planning to mobilize hundreds of thousands of troops after September polls there.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What is the 'political firewall' against Germany's far-right AfD?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:16a31a5bc9931a63f9dcf457c6a58d42d0923bc6657b41db5601a3ab8b387a3b</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-23T09:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-is-the-political-firewall-against-germany-s-far-right-afd/a-78431554--c6365f6b6345.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-is-the-political-firewall-against-germany-s-far-right-afd/a-78431554?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's centrist parties reject any cooperation with the Alternative for Germany (AfD), parts of which are classified as right-wing extremist. However, this policy is coming under increasing pressure.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Sydney Marathon medal wrongly shows German landmark</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cc655bd2feb40ec8e961b13eb628bdb39b70a3985e9c5c5f113a749666258128</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:02Z</updated><published>2026-08-23T06:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/sydney-marathon-medal-wrongly-shows-german-landmark/a-78473705--c4d12c38e946.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/sydney-marathon-medal-wrongly-shows-german-landmark/a-78473705?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A medal minted for finishers in the Sydney Marathon features a skyline of the city — with one landmark from rather far away. Organizers say the muddle only makes the medal "a little more unique."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><titl